# 5 39 / 44 0 / 5 -39 / -34 0 (32 m); the keep 2..8 x -4.5..4.5 (its study 31 m, the roof 37 m); the magazine in its pit
# -8..-2 x -4.5..4.5 (24.5 m), its lock at -1.5 -5.6; the sea-cave store 2..8 x -87..-81 (5 m down); the guardhouse
# 86..92 x -46.5..-37.5 (2 m), the ramp's foot at 82 -47.
