# Raft's story machinery: the quartermaster's keycard door refuses without the card; his satchel on the glacis gives
# it; the door goes and shows the strongroom chest. The hatch on the parade ground and the stores under it
use qmdoor
expect message keycard
expect hidden qmvault
open Quartermaster's satchel
expect story raft-Tangaroa_KeyCard 1
use qmdoor
expect hidden qmdoor
expect shown qmvault
open Strongroom chest
expect item TradeToken 6
expect hidden storehatchchest
use storehatch
